      en: ['Cook the pasta al dente. Thinly slice the fennel and chop the garlic. Fry fennel, garlic and fennel seeds in the oil for 5 minutes over medium heat.', 'Deglaze with the white wine and boil for 1 minute. Stir in the tomatoes and crème fraîche, season and bring to the boil.', 'Add the prawns and simmer gently for about 5 minutes. Serve the pasta with the sauce and scatter over the mint leaves.'],
