      en: ['Cook the rice according to the packet. Finely chop the garlic and peeled ginger.', 'Fry the curry paste, garlic and ginger in the oil over low heat for 2 minutes. Add the coconut milk, bring to the boil and simmer covered for 10 minutes.', 'After 3 minutes add the mangetout and the pak choi stalks. Cut the cod into 2 cm pieces and add them for the last 4 minutes.', 'Stir in the pak choi leaves and serve the curry over the rice.'],
